<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Maurice (emperor)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">murdered 602 CE</span> · <a href="/centuries/7th-century">7th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Maurice was a Byzantine emperor who reigned from 582 until 602. He helped restore <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khosrow-ii">Khosrow II</a> to the Sasanian throne, securing peace with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persia">Persia</a>. His murder by the usurper <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/phocas">Phocas</a> in 602 gave Khosrow II a pretext for a long war against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byzantine-empire">Byzantines</a> that exhausted both empires and weakened the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a>.</p></div>
